# Counters stay on a permanent when it stops being a creature, and count again when it next becomes one: the animation
# sets base power and toughness (layer 7b) and counters apply after (layer 7c, CR 613.4b-c). On turn 3 Bot1 animates its
# Inkmoth Nexus and Battlefield Improvisation makes it a 3/3; it attacks, and Bot2 animates its own Inkmoth Nexus and
# blocks. Bot1's deals 3 infect damage, three -1/-1 counters that kill Bot2's 1/1 (CR 702.90c, 704.5f); Bot2's deals 1,
# a -1/-1 counter on Bot1's, which survives as a 2/2. After the cleanup step (CR 514.2) it is a Land with that counter.
# On turn 5 it is animated again: a 1/1 with a -1/-1 counter is 0/0 and goes to the graveyard.

